          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba bamunyasinjia nobuchesichesi bwabwe, obwa bamukaatiye ninabwo mwikhuwa liePeori, kata mwikhuwa liaKozibi omukhaana womukhulundu weMidiani, omukhaana wabwe, oweerwa khunyanga yoluumbe, mwikhuwa liePeori.",
          "type": "text",
